          <p style="margin:0;padding:0 44px 22px 2px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px">You can start with one space or a list of connected priorities. Tell us what is no longer working in your home and what you want to improve; the consultation is intended to help define a useful project direction.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="border-bottom:1px solid #B5BCC0">
